---
---

<section class="features">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <div class="section-header">
      <p class="section-label">Capabilities</p>
      <h2 class="section-title">What your agent does</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-list">
      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-number">01</div>
        <div class="feature-body">
          <h3>Intelligent orchestration</h3>
          <p>Your agent manages projects, coordinates resources, and handles communication across your entire digital ecosystem — all from within an encrypted enclave.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-number">02</div>
        <div class="feature-body">
          <h3>Private knowledge base</h3>
          <p>Daily summaries from your trusted sources. Personal knowledge integration. Research powered by confidential inference, so no one sees what you're searching for.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-number">03</div>
        <div class="feature-body">
          <h3>Confidential inference</h3>
          <p>Your prompts are encrypted before reaching the model. Responses are encrypted before leaving the enclave. The model provider never sees your data — your queries, your context, your outputs.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-number">04</div>
        <div class="feature-body">
          <h3>Tool access without exposure</h3>
          <p>Connects to external services and specialized capabilities through encrypted channels. Your data never leaves the enclave unencrypted.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    padding: 8rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #1A1A1D;
  }

  .section-inner {
    max-width: 48rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .section-header {
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #555558;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #F5F5F5;
  }

  .feature-list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .feature-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 4rem 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    padding: 2.5rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #1A1A1D;
  }

  .feature-list > :first-child {
    border-top: 1px solid #1A1A1D;
  }

  .feature-number {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    color: #555558;
    padding-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .feature-body h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #F5F5F5;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .feature-body p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #8A8A8E;
    max-width: 32rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .features { padding: 5rem 1.25rem; }
    .section-header { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .feature-row {
      grid-template-columns: 3rem 1fr;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 2rem 0;
    }
  }
</style>
